"numSkills": 3, "about": "From Manchester and currently completing my DofE gold, & Ml (mountain leader) training and finishing my year-long contract of being a youth worker and doing educational talks on experiences , diver...", "experiences": {"0": {"Workplace": "Support Worker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "I assist in carrying out of a range of activities in working with children, young people and their families individually or in groups, at risk of adverse outcomes and providing cover for a range of tasks and duties which are undertaken within the service. I will with 11-19yrs ( and up to 25 for those with additional needs) who may need support in making a positive transition to adulthood. The young people I work with may be vulnerable and require help and support their difficulties from escalating. I assist in the delivery of issue based programmes using recreational activities and resources to support youth engagement process."}, "1": {"Workplace": "Support Worker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Skills: Hospitality · Leadership · Customer Service · Coaching · Personal Development"}, "2": {"Workplace": "Youth Worker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Youth worker entails working closely and long term with young person , coaching and having one to one sessions with them on their developments. It entails organising fundraisers and walks, informative talks to community members and trustees and regular meetings with staff. It includes having safeguarding, child protection , DBS checks and first aid training. I have also been apart of shadowing outdoor instructors on outdoor activities such as high ropes, caving, scrambling and climbing and assisting in sessions. It includes setting up for sessions throughout holidays / half term and drop in sessions."}, "3": {"Workplace": "Youth Worker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Skills: Youth Work · Management · Team Leadership"}, "4": {"Workplace": "Youth Worker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Episode 086: Alishba, From Manchester to the Mountains"}, "5": {"Workplace": "Motivational Speaker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "I started my first talk at 19 and it just started off with me simply talking about my experience as a south asain women in the outdoors, coming from an all girls household. The more I spoke, the more it grew on me that talking about my personal story means I am actively healing and inspiring at the same time. It wasn’t until the feedback I was getting after a few more talks with young peoples/ teachers/ professionals that I realised it’s something I should stick at. Spreading educational awareness about certain barriers the south asain community face in the outdoor industry and what to start looking at to make it inclusive.””"}, "6": {"Workplace": "Motivational Speaker", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Skills: Leadership"}, "7": {"Workplace": "Mentor", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Receptionist/ mentor. Giving out new homework, collecting previous homework , speaking with parents and handling payments"}, "8": {"Workplace": "Mentor", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Skills: Teaching · Cash Handling"}, "9": {"Workplace": "Retail Assistant", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Christmas role of managing the f&f clothing department and making sure everything is in stock. Tidying and putting all the clothes in size order."}, "10": {"Workplace": "Retail Assistant", "Role": "", "Duration": "", "Workplace Location": "", "Description": "Skills: Retail · Customer Service"}}, "workplaces": ["Support Worker", "Youth Worker", "Motivational Speaker", "Mentor", "Retail Assistant"], "simhash": 12640740062